  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A power analysis as part of the strategy process with the aim to      better provide Sweden with a better understanding of who the main     agents are, how they relate, what their power bases are and how       donors can contribute to a positive dynamics that contibutes to       peace, security and democratic development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Maktanalys som en del av strategiprocessen i syfte att b&#xe4;ttre f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;  vilka de viktigaste akt&#xf6;rerna &#xe4;r, hur de interagerar, vad deras       makbas &#xe4;r och hur givarna kan st&#xf6;dja en positiv dynamik som fr&#xe4;mjar   fred, s&#xe4;kerhet och en demokratisk utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
